The old step printed #print axioms for 14 hand-picked theorems and only grepped the
word 'sorry': a custom 'axiom cheat : ∀ p, p' or native_decide (aux axiom
*._native.native_decide.ax_*) passes it, and theorems outside the list (e.g.
guards_irrelevant, toChart_decls) were never checked. An unchecked declaration added
via addDeclCore (doCheck := false) shows 'does not depend on any axioms'.

audit/proofs/strict_gate.sh: static ban on sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide/
skipKernelTC/run_elab/modifyEnv/addDeclCore/unsafe/csimp in sources; #print axioms
for ALL theorems extracted from sources (count must match); AxiomGate.lean over every
theorem/def/opaque of Figram.* modules; pinned statements (Statements.lean);
leanchecker kernel replay of all Figram.* modules.

Before (baseline verify.sh): canaries pass the gate (LOGS/16-canary-baseline-verify).
After: both canaries red, clean tree green (LOGS/16-canary-patched-verify, LOGS/25).

(cherry picked from commit 90201dd62d520ba465d414745d65cad326e33609)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JgWRtX2jyUidN8gxEhe5qx
---
 audit/proofs/strict_gate.sh |  5 +++++
 verify.sh                   | 26 +++++---------------------
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

diff --git a/audit/proofs/strict_gate.sh b/audit/proofs/strict_gate.sh
index 50cc40a..52b37c1 100755
--- a/audit/proofs/strict_gate.sh
+++ b/audit/proofs/strict_gate.sh
@@ -13,6 +13,11 @@
 set -euo pipefail
 cd "$(dirname "$0")/../.."
 T=$(mktemp -d); trap 'rm -rf "$T"' EXIT
+# 0. static: constructs that bypass or weaken checking must not appear in project sources
+if grep -nE '\bsorry\b|\badmit\b|^[[:space:]]*(private |protected )?axiom\b|native_decide|ofReduceBool|ofReduceNat|trustCompiler|debug\.skipKernelTC|\brun_elab\b|\brun_cmd\b|\brun_meta\b|modifyEnv|addDeclCore|\bunsafe\b|@\[csimp\]' \
+     Figram/*.lean Figram.lean Main.lean EngineMain.lean; then
+  echo "STRICT GATE: forbidden construct in sources (see lines above)"; exit 1
+fi
 python3 -I audit/proofs/gen_axioms.py . audit/proofs/AllAxioms.lean audit/proofs/theorems.txt
 n=$(wc -l < audit/proofs/theorems.txt)
 lake env lean audit/proofs/AllAxioms.lean > "$T/ax.log" 2>&1
diff --git a/verify.sh b/verify.sh
index d554ed0..f2c2ead 100755
--- a/verify.sh
+++ b/verify.sh
@@ -48,27 +48,11 @@ for b in figram figram-engine; do cp .lake/build/bin/$b "$T/$b" && strip "$T/$b"
 # (сборка ffi/out нужна шагам C и Go ниже)
 (cd "$T" && sha256sum figram figram-engine) | diff - bin/SHA256SUMS && echo "ok: хеши совпадают побайтно"
 
-step "Теоремы без sorry"
-cat > "$T/ax.lean" <<'LEAN'
-import Figram
-open Figram Figram.Format
-#print axioms Chart.compile_correct
-#print axioms Chart.session_correct
-#print axioms Chart.chart_run_valid
-#print axioms Machine.step_state_valid
-#print axioms Machine.step_guard_local
-#print axioms decode_encode
-#print axioms encode_injective
-#print axioms decode_requires
-#print axioms toChart_strip
-#print axioms check_roundtrip
-#print axioms Engine.decSnapshot_encSnapshot
-#print axioms Engine.step_snapOK
-#print axioms Engine.handle_step
-#print axioms Engine.reply_readable
-LEAN
-lake env lean "$T/ax.lean" | tee "$T/ax.log"
-if grep -q sorry "$T/ax.log"; then exit 1; fi
+step "Теоремы: только propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice; ядро перепроверено"
+# Все теоремы из исходников (а не список из 14), все определения модулей Figram.*,
+# запрет объявлений axiom, sorryAx, native_decide; формулировки теорем README/AUDIT
+# закреплены; leanchecker заново проверяет ядром каждое объявление.
+SHOW=4 logged proofs bash audit/proofs/strict_gate.sh
 
 step "Фиксированные сценарии совпадают с сохранёнными"
 $F golden "$T/golden" >/dev/null
